## Method note

- Start dates: `GET /categories/{id}/rollover_options` (server-rendered HTML), parsed for "Rollover both starting on {date}".
- Balances: `/trends/{id}` budget analysis panel, "Rollover balance" line, read from the rendered DOM.
- Both required an authenticated real-browser session (Interceptor) because PocketSmith's v2 API exposes only `rollover_type` (on/off), never the start date or balance.
